{
  "id": "section-924",
  "title": "关于国际形势的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-304.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>304)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　有人说，美苏战略中心转移，我不赞成。他们是注意远东，但中心还在欧洲。欧洲七个师的兵力，并没有减少，只是调了几万老兵到远东。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-303.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-305.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
